<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Hyperparameters Setting</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The proposed model is designed to learn a variable number of latent states, denoted by <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{Q}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{Q}</annotation></semantics></math>. In our experiments, we evaluated performance under two configurations: <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{Q}=5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{Q}=5</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{Q}=30" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{Q}=30</annotation></semantics></math>.
The recurrent neural network (RNN) component was configured as an LSTM of two layers (<span id="A1.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">num_layers</span> = 2) and an output dimensionality of <span id="A1.SS2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">rnn_outputs</span> = 5. The size of the hidden state in the RNN was set to <span id="A1.SS2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">rnn_hidden_size</span> = 50.
For the Advantage Actor-Critic (A2C) architecture, the hidden layer size was fixed at <span id="A1.SS2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">hidden_size</span> = 120. The learning rate of the optimizer is set to <span id="A1.SS2.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">lr=0.0004</span> while the temperature value used is 0.5.</p>
</div>
</section>
